descriptions.desc:
When Nekomata has <color=#FFFFFF>40</color> or more [Purr Energy], after triggering <color=#FFFFFF>[Perfect Dodge]</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_Evade> to consume 30 [Purr Energy] and activate:
Nekomata enters Vital View and quickly dashes behind the enemy;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill, and this skill does not consume dodge charges;

After using <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge: Vanishing Tail Technique]</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> or hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> when having 40 or more [Purr Energy] to activate:
Launch a powerful Slash against enemies in a large area ahead, dealing massive <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Special> to activate:
Unleashes a downward strike, dealing <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color>;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill;
The skill's follow-up attack effect is enhanced.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> after an <color=#FFFFFF>Evasive Assist</color> to activate:
Order Drusilla and Anastella to push forward and generate an electrical vortex, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Can quickly chain into <color=#FFFFFF>[Enhanced Special: Fool Vanishing Magic]</color> during this skill;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Perform up to 6 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color>;
The 6th hit of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color> is also considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Dash Attack]</color>, and Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill.

With enough Energy, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Leaps into the air to launch multiple consecutive kicks forward, then sweeps across, dealing massive <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill, and it is also considered as a <color=#FFFFFF>[Dash Attack]</color>.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Perform up to 4 consecutive attacks forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
If a Basic Attack hits the target, the Character recovers <color=#FFFFFF>[Plume Gauge]</color> after the skill ends;
The 4th Basic Attack hit applies 1 <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color> to the target.

Hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Perform a wide-range Slash forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumiflux Attribute DMG</color>;
If the skill hits a target, the Character recovers <color=#FFFFFF>[Feather Gauge]</color> after the skill ends.

When the Character has <color=#FFFFFF>[Void Radiance]</color> stored, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launch a powerful large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumiflux Attribute DMG</color>;
After the skill ends, restore a large amount of <color=#FFFFFF>[Plume Gauge]</color> for the Character;
If the attack hits a target, trigger the <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> effect after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:110+AvatarSkillLevel(0)*3,1,2}%</color>;
All stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Void Radiance]</color> will be cleared upon activation.

When the Character has stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Void Radiance]</color> and is in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Mirror Radiance]</color> state, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launch a powerful large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
After the skill ends, restore a large amount of <color=#FFFFFF>[Feather Gauge]</color> for the Character;
If it hits a target, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> effect can be triggered after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:220+AvatarSkillLevel(0)*5,1,2}%</color>;
After activation, all stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Void Radiance]</color> will be cleared.

With enough Energy, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Upon entering the battlefield, if the user's Energy is below 60, restore it to 60. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger at most once every 180 seconds;
Launch a large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
After the skill ends, apply 2 <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Points]</color> to hit enemies;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Hold <IconMap:Icon_Special> to activate:
Enter <color=#FFFFFF>[Shift Stance]</color> after a <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>. While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Shift Stance]</color>, switching characters when the character's <color=#FFFFFF>[Newfeather Gauge]</color> reaches its max value of 120 will allow entry into the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state:
While in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state, the character acts autonomously to assist in combat. Some attacks can also apply <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color> to targets. The <color=#FFFFFF>[Newfeather Gauge]</color> is consumed over time while in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state. When the <color=#FFFFFF>[Newfeather Gauge]</color> is fully depleted, the character exits the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state. Before exiting <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color>, the character cannot be switched in by any means other than a <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Attack]</color>;
If the character triggers 3 <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute</color> <color=#FFA9DD>[Refringe]</color> reactions while in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state, or if the character's stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantom Radiance]</color> count is 1 or more when the <color=#FFFFFF>[Newfeather Gauge]</color> is depleted, the character activates <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist: Featherbloom Waltz]</color>. Upon activation, Normal Switch-In is unlocked, and the character will automatically trigger <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist: Featherbloom Waltz]</color> on the next Normal Switch-In;
Upon entering the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state, the character grants all squad members a DMG dealt increase of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:0+AvatarSkillLevel(1)*1.5,1,2}%</color> for 60s; repeated triggers reset the duration;
If the character's <color=#FFFFFF>[Newfeather Gauge]</color> reaches its max value of 120 and a <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> hits a Stunned enemy, switching characters during the <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> can also trigger the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state;
If no character switch is made after entering <color=#FFFFFF>[Shift Stance]</color>, Remie performs a downward attack to return to the ground.

When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Launches a multi-hit large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
Upon activation, the character enters <color=#FFFFFF>[Radiant Gleam]</color> state, upgrading the next <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Cascading Rainbow]</color> to <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Fleeting Grace]</color>;
After the skill ends, applies 2 <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Points]</color> to hit enemies;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Perform a multi-hit attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
If the attack hits a target, trigger the <color=#FFFFFF>Luminize</color> effect after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:230+AvatarSkillLevel(3)*5.2,1,2}%</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Enter the field and unleash a large area bombardment, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
Costs 40 <color=#FFFFFF>[Neofeather]</color> upon activation. If the remaining <color=#FFFFFF>[Neofeather]</color> is at or below 90 when activated, <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist: Feathered Waltz]</color> will not consume <color=#FFFFFF>[Neofeather]</color>, and the character enters the <color=#FFFFFF>[Radiance]</color> state, upgrading the next <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Cascade]</color> to <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Soaring Flash]</color>;
When this skill hits an enemy in a Stunned state, the enemy's Stun duration is extended by 3s. Each enemy can only receive this effect once per Stun state. This Stun duration extension cannot stack with effects of the same type;
If a target is hit, a <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> effect can be triggered after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:220+AvatarSkillLevel(6)*5,1,2}%</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

desc:
Remie's <color=#FFA9DD>[Mutation Coefficient]</color> equals <color=#2BAD00>0.01%</color> of her own Anomaly Proficiency. When the number of <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> Characters in the team is 3, the <color=#FFA9DD>[Mutation Coefficient]</color> is additionally increased by 15%;
When a teammate triggers a <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute</color> <color=#FFA9DD>[Mutation]</color> Reaction for the Character, Remie generates <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminos]</color> based on the <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Intensity]</color> of the Attribute Anomaly effect after being boosted by <color=#FFA9DD>[Mutation]</color>. Up to 3 of the most recently generated <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminos]</color> can be stored;
If <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist Skill: Feather Waltz]</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: Grand Finale]</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Cascade]</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Flashwing]</color> hits a target, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> effect can be triggered after the skill ends:
Based on the <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Intensity]</color> of all stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminos]</color>, deal Attribute Anomaly DMG to enemies at the skill's corresponding multiplier, and increase this DMG Multiplier by <color=#2BAD00>0.1%</color> of her own Anomaly Proficiency;
When the Character enters the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state or after using <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Cascade]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Flashwing]</color>, all stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminos]</color> will be cleared.

Triggers when another <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> Character or same-Faction Character exists in your squad:
When the number of <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> Characters in your squad is 1/2/3, entering the battlefield grants all squad members a boost to ATK equal to 7.5%/15%/40% of Remie's initial ATK, with a cap of 1,600, and Daze dealt by this character while in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state is increased by 7.5%/15%/35%;
Additionally, when this character applies <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color> to an enemy, they also inflict the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantachrome]</color> effect on that enemy: While under the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantachrome]</color> effect, when an enemy takes Attribute Anomaly DMG, their Anomaly Buildup Rate is increased by 15%. When the enemy has no <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color>, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantachrome]</color> effect expires. After the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantachrome]</color> effect expires, the Anomaly Buildup Rate increase when the enemy takes Attribute Anomaly DMG persists for an additional 8 seconds.

Remie's <color=#FFA9DD>[Mutation Coefficient]</color> is <color=#2BAD00>0.01%</color> of her own Anomaly Proficiency. When the number of <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> Characters in the team is 3, the <color=#FFA9DD>[Mutation Coefficient]</color> is further increased by 15%;
