Based on the <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Buildup Intensity]</color> of all stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantom Radiance]</color>, deal Attribute Anomaly DMG to enemies at the skill's corresponding multiplier, and increase this DMG Multiplier based on <color=#2BAD00>0.12%</color> of own Anomaly Proficiency;
All stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Phantom Radiance]</color> on the Character will be cleared upon entering the <color=#FFFFFF>[Phase Flux]</color> state or after using <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Cascading Rainbow]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Fleeting Crane]</color>.

